WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Cooling airflow. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Trace inlet, heat exchanger and outlet

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Cooling flow needs an inlet, pressure path, heat exchanger and outlet. Air entering the nose is not automatically useful cooling flow.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Draw the complete path and identify where flow can leak around the radiator rather than through it.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Flow-path audit

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Simplified flow picture; real values need test method and conditions.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Trace inlet, heat exchanger and outlet
